{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-heavy-atom-examples-table6-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-heavy-atom-examples-table6-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 6 from tm-heavy-atom-examples","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-heavy-atom-examples"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-heavy-atom-examples-table6-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:tm-heavy-atom-examples-table6-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Data table 6 from tm-heavy-atom-examples</em></p>\n<p>Magic-number lookup for the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^{210}\\mathrm{Bi}\\,(Z = 83,\\ N = 127) \\to {}^{210}\\mathrm{Po}</code> decay of Example 8. The parent proton and neutron counts each sit one above a magic number (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">82</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">126</code>), so both carry <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_{\\mathrm{out}} = 1</code>; the daughter's neutron count <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N' = 126</code> lands exactly on the highest magic number, closing the shell (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_{\\mathrm{out}} = 0</code>).</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Nucleon count</th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_{\\leq}</code></th>\n<th align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_{\\mathrm{out}}</code></th>\n<th align=\"center\">Shell size</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z = 83</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">82</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">126 - 82 = 44</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N = 127</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">126</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">126 - 82 = 44</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z' = 84</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">82</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">44</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N' = 126</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">126</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code> (magic!)</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">44</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
